        "TileImage": "$($repository 73349b54-9b7a-47a8-906e-e04ad44ae174).Image",
        "Description": "I can guarantee at least one of these guys has never been one of your targets. That&apos;s because they&apos;re underused, and aren&apos;t an absolute cakewalk.\r\rUse targets like these in your contracts, instead of those really common targets that literally everyone uses and are either story characters or two seconds away from an exit. Anyway, enough of my ramblings.\r\rThese blokes are members of an arms trafficking syndicate. Good luck.\r\rAnd uh, have fun!",
